arker_vectors(a, sys.argv[2:]))\nprint(\"wrote\", sys.argv[1], len(sys.argv) - 2, \"messages\")\ntext\tcorrect\nCan I get support?\taccount_security\nWhat countries have access to this service.\taccount_security\nIf I don't live in the UK, can I get a card?\taccount_security\nWhat countries do your services support?\taccount_security\nHow old does one need to be?\taccount_security\nDo you provide cards to people not in the UK?\taccount_security\nCan my children get an account?\taccount_security\nwhere do you have locations at\taccount_security\nWhat is the age limit for an account?\taccount_security\nWhere can I get a card in the EU?\taccount_security\nI am in the EU. Can I get one of your cards?\taccount_security\nWhat countries can I use the card in?\taccount_security\nIs this card available to United States Residents?\taccount_security\nIs it possible for me to set up separate accounts for my kids?\taccount_security\nIs it possible for a person who lives in the US to get a card?\taccount_security\nWhat are the requirements to open an account for a minor?\taccount_security\nI can use this card at which ATMs?\tcards\nTell me how to replace my expired card.\tcards\nHow do I use disposable cards?\tcards\nCan it specifically be delivered on a certain date?\tcards\nI need to change my contact information.\taccount_security\nWhat is the process to link the new card?\tcards\nCan I put my found card back into the app on my phone?\tcards\nI'd prefer to use my American Express when putting funds into my account.\tcards\nI've just got married and want to change my name.\taccount_security\nI seem to have lost my card.\tcards\nWhich ATMs take the card?\tcards\nCard delivery services? Where?\tcards\nHow can I report that my card was stolen? I made a police report first.\tcards\nI think my card is expiring, what happens then?\tcards\nWhat are the steps for identity checks?\taccount_security\nWhat do i do to get a physical card?\tcards","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":f