{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgiMkQcqbrr6FjCU4GztN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0194hZtxKMAh3457d1CVi1an","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>","content":"# Second batch of messages I wrote. Same split: eligibility vs. control.\nELIG2 = [\n    # age\n    \"How old do I need to be to get an account?\",\n    \"Is 17 old enough to open an account?\",\n    \"My son is 15, can he have a card?\",\n    \"Do you have accounts for under 18s?\",\n    \"Can a 13 year old sign up?\",\n    \"What's the minimum age for a card?\",\n    \"Are there age restrictions?\",\n    \"Can pensioners open an account?\",\n    \"Is there an age requirement for the app?\",\n    \"Can I open an account for my teenage daughter?\",\n    \"Do you allow minors to hold accounts?\",\n    \"I am 16 and want a card, is that allowed?\",\n    \"Does my child need to be a certain age to get a card?\",\n    \"Can a university student under 18 sign up?\",\n    \"What is the age restriction for a junior card?\",\n    \"Is there a maximum age to be a customer?\",\n    \"Can my elderly father open an account at 75?\",\n    \"At what age can you start using the app?\",\n    \"Can my kids each have their own account?\",\n    \"Can I get a card for my 10 year old?\",\n    # country / residency\n    \"Do you accept customers in Ireland?\",\n    \"Can I open an account from Poland?\",\n    \"Is the app available in New Zealand?\",\n    \"I live in South Africa, can I use your service?\",\n    \"Which countries can sign up for an account?\",\n    \"Do you operate in the Netherlands?\",\n    \"Can residents of Norway get a card?\",\n    \"I'm based in Dubai, am I eligible?\",\n    \"Can I join from Argentina?\",\n    \"Are accounts available in Hong Kong?\",\n    \"Do you serve customers in Nigeria?\",\n    \"Is your card offered in Portugal?\",\n    \"Can someone living in Italy become a customer?\",\n    \"What countries do you support for new accounts?\",\n    \"Where are you available?\",\n    \"In which countries can I open an account?\",\n    \"Can I use your service if I am in Canada?\",\n    \"Do you accept applicants from the Philippines?\",\n    \"Can I register with a French address?\",\n    \"Is the service open to people in Greece?\",\n    \"Do I need a UK address to sign up?\",\n    \"Can I apply with a non-UK phone number?\",\n    \"I am a US citizen living in London, can I open an account?\",\n    \"Can expats open an account?\",\n    \"Do you require residency in the EU?\",\n    \"Can I keep my account if I move to America?\",\n    \"Which regions is the card supported in?\",\n    \"Can I open an account while travelling abroad?\",\n    \"Do you offer accounts to people in Asia?\",\n    \"Can a non-EU citizen get a card?\",\n    \"What countries is the service not available in?\",\n    \"Are Indian residents able to open an account?\",\n    \"Is this available for Australians?\",\n    \"I don't live in Europe, can I still sign up?\",\n    \"Can I get an account if I'm from Pakistan?\",\n    \"Do you support UAE customers?\",\n    \"Can I open an account with a Spanish ID?\",\n    \"Which passports do you accept for opening an account?\",\n    \"Is the card available in my country, Romania?\",\n    \"Can tourists open an account?\",\n    # who may open / general eligibility\n    \"Who can open an account with you?\",\n    \"What are the eligibility criteria for an account?\",\n    \"What do I need to qualify for a card?\",\n    \"Am I eligible for an account?\",\n    \"What are the conditions to become a customer?\",\n    \"Can anyone sign up or are there restrictions?\",\n    \"Can my wife and I open accounts separately?\",\n    \"Can I open an account for my mother?\",\n    \"Can I open an account on behalf of someone else?\",\n    \"Do I need to be a citizen to open an account?\",\n    \"Can I have an account if I am a student?\",\n    \"Can a refugee open an account?\",\n    \"Can I open an account without a permanent address?\",\n    \"Is there any restriction on who can get the card?\",\n    \"Who is allowed to use the card?\",\n    \"Do you accept customers with dual nationality?\",\n    \"Can I sign up if I'm not a resident anywhere right now?\",\n    \"Can I open a second account for my brother?\",\n    \"Can I apply for an account for my children and myself?\",\n    \"Is this service for UK residents only?\",\n]\n\nCONTROL2 = [\n    # cards: get / order / where / available (hard negatives)\n    \"How do I get a card?\",\n    \"Where is my card?\",\n    \"Can I order a new card?\",\n    \"How do I get a physical card delivered?\",\n    \"Where can I pick up my card?\",\n    \"Can I get a card in a different colour?\",\n    \"How long does it take to get a card?\",\n    \"Is the virtual card available right now?\",\n    \"Can I get a card for my joint account?\",\n    \"Where do I find my card number?\",\n    \"Can I get a card sent to a different address?\",\n    \"Can I get a replacement card while abroad?\",\n    \"Do you deliver cards to work addresses?\",\n    \"Can I use the card in shops abroad?\",\n    \"Will my card work in Japan?\",\n    \"Does the card work in all countries?\",\n    \"Can I use my card at an ATM in Spain?\",\n    \"I'm travelling to Thailand, will my card work there?\",\n    \"Can I withdraw cash abroad with the card?\",\n    \"Which ATMs can I use abroad?\",\n    \"Can I have more than one card?\",\n    \"Is there a limit on how many cards I can have?\",\n    \"My card was swallowed by the ATM.\",\n    \"How do I unblock my card?\",\n    \"The chip on my card is broken.\",\n    \"Can I set a custom PIN?\",\n    \"Can I get a card with my own design?\",\n    \"Do you offer a kids card?\",\n    \"How do I view my card details in the app?\",\n    \"I want to cancel my card.\",\n    \"Can I put the card in Google Pay?\",\n    \"How do I pay with contactless?\",\n    \"Is there a spending limit on the card?\",\n    \"My card expired, how do I get a new one?\",\n    \"Can I track my card delivery?\",\n    \"The card is not working in the machine.\",\n    \"How do I report my card lost?\",\n    \"Can I get a disposable virtual card for online shopping?\",\n    # disputes\n    \"I don't recognise a charge from yesterday.\",\n    \"The ATM did not give me cash but my balance went down.\",\n    \"A payment is pending for five days.\",\n    \"I was double charged at the restaurant.\",\n    \"The shop refunded me but I can't see it.\",\n    \"A payment was reverted, where is my money?\",\n    \"My online purchase was declined.\",\n    \"Can I get my money back for a subscription I cancelled?\",\n    \"There's a transaction I didn't make.\",\n    \"How long does a refund take to show?\",\n    # transfers\n    \"How do I send money to another bank?\",\n    \"My top up failed.\",\n    \"Can I top up with a credit card?\",\n    \"I sent money to the wrong account.\",\n    \"How do I receive money from abroad?\",\n    \"The transfer shows as completed but my friend didn't get it.\",\n    \"What are the transfer limits?\",\n    \"Can I set up a standing order?\",\n    \"My deposit is not showing in my balance.\",\n    \"How do I add money to my account?\",\n    # fees_fx\n    \"What fees apply when I pay in a foreign currency?\",\n    \"How much do you charge for international transfers?\",\n    \"What rate do you use for currency exchange?\",\n    \"The exchange rate I got on my withdrawal was bad.\",\n    \"I was charged a worse rate than Google shows.\",\n    \"Which currencies can I exchange?\",\n    \"Are there monthly fees?\",\n    \"Why was I charged a fee on an ATM withdrawal?\",\n    \"Do you charge for weekend exchanges?\",\n    \"Can I hold a balance in yen?\",\n    # account_security, non-eligibility\n    \"How do I reset my passcode?\",\n    \"I lost my phone, can you lock my account?\",\n    \"How do I update my personal details?\",\n    \"Can I change my 