om {c}?\",\n    \"I am moving to {c}, can I keep my account?\", \"Will you be launching in {c}?\", \"Can someone from {c} get an account?\",\n    \"Does the service work in {c}?\", \"Is {c} supported?\", \"Can I get your card in {c}?\", \"Do you have the service in {c}?\",\n    \"Can my friend in {c} open an account?\", \"When will you be available in {c}?\", \"Are accounts offered in {c}?\",\n    \"Can I use this if I'm based in {c}?\", \"Do you take customers living in {c}?\",\n]\nC_GENERIC = [\n    \"Which countries are you available in?\", \"What countries do you support?\", \"Where are you available?\", \"Where do you operate?\",\n    \"Do you have locations in Asia?\", \"Where in the world can I sign up?\", \"Which countries can open an account?\", \"What countries is this available in?\",\n    \"Is this available outside the UK?\", \"Can I use this if I don't live in the UK?\", \"Do I have to live in the UK?\", \"Can non-UK residents get a card?\",\n    \"Which regions do you serve?\", \"Are you only in Europe?\", \"Are you available internationally?\", \"What countries is the card for?\",\n    \"Where can I get an account?\", \"Are you global?\", \"Do you work in other countries?\", \"What countries can sign up?\",\n    \"Is there a list of supported countries?\", \"Do you have the card in my country?\", \"Which nationalities do you accept?\",\n    \"Can I open an account if I am not a UK citizen?\", \"Do you need a UK address to open an account?\", \"I don't live in Europe, can I join?\",\n    \"Can I get the card outside Europe?\", \"Which countries can I get the card in?\", \"Can I get the card if I live abroad?\",\n    \"Is the app for UK customers only?\",\n]\nA_TEMPL = [\n    \"Can {k} open an account?\", \"Can {k} get a card?\", \"Is {k} allowed to have an account?\", \"Can I open an account for {k}?\",\n    \"Can {k} use the app?\", \"I'd like a card for {k}, is that possible?\", \"Does {k} qualify for an account?\", \"Can I set up an account for {k}