support?\", \"Which currencies are supported?\", \"Do you support euros?\", \"Can I hold US dollars?\", \"Do you support Japanese yen?\",\n    \"Is the Canadian dollar supported?\", \"What fiat currencies can I hold?\", \"Which currencies can I exchange into?\", \"Can I exchange into Swiss francs?\",\n    \"Do you support Indian rupees?\", \"Can I hold multiple currencies?\", \"Is there a list of currencies?\", \"Do you accept Australian dollars?\",\n    \"What currencies can I top up in?\", \"Do you take Mexican pesos?\", \"Can I hold Polish zloty?\", \"Is the euro available in the app?\",\n    \"What cards do you support?\", \"Which cards can I top up with?\", \"Do you support Mastercard?\", \"Can I top up with Visa?\", \"Do you accept American Express?\",\n    \"When will my card arrive?\", \"How long does the card take to arrive?\", \"Where is my card? I ordered it a week ago.\", \"My card still hasn't come.\",\n    \"Can I track the delivery of my card?\", \"How do I order a physical card?\", \"I want a physical card.\", \"How do I get a new card?\",\n    \"Can I get another card?\", \"How do I get a virtual card?\", \"Can I get a card for my partner?\", \"Where is my card being sent to?\",\n    \"Which shops accept the card?\", \"Is my card accepted everywhere?\", \"Where is the card accepted?\", \"Can I use the card online?\",\n    \"Can I use the card for subscriptions?\", \"Does the card work with Netflix?\", \"Can I use the card at an ATM?\", \"Will the card work at the airport?\",\n    \"Can I use my card abroad?\", \"Does my card work overseas?\", \"Can I pay abroad with the card?\", \"Is there a charge for using the card abroad?\",\n    \"What is the exchange rate when I pay abroad?\", \"Do you charge for foreign transactions?\", \"What is the fee for ATM withdrawals abroad?\",\n    \"How do I change my delivery address?\", \"Can I update my home address?\", \"I moved house, how do I update my details?\", \"Change my address please.\",\n    \"How do I change my name?\", \"How do I update my date of birth?\", \"My details are wrong, how do I fix them?\", \"Can I edit my personal information?\",\n    \"How do I verify my identity?\", \"Why do I need to verify my identity?\", \"What documents do you need?\", \"How do I prove my address?\",\n    \"I'm travelling, will there be fees?\", \"Do you have offices I can visit?\", \"Can I visit a branch?\", \"Is there a helpline?\",\n    \"How do I contact you?\", \"Can I get support by phone?\", \"Is there live chat support?\", \"How do I get help?\",\n    \"Can I open a joint account?\", \"Can I open a business account?\", \"Can I have two accounts?\", \"Can I open a savings account?\",\n    \"How do I open an account?\", \"What do I need to open an account?\", \"How long does opening an account take?\", \"Can I open an account today?\",\n]\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":41,"oldLines":5,"newStart":41,"newLines":5,"lines":["     \"I'm travelling, will there be fees?\", \"Do you have offices I can visit?\", \"Can I visit a branch?\", \"Is there a helpline?\",","     \"How do I contact you?\", \"Can I get support by phone?\", \"Is there live chat support?\", \"How do I get help?\",","     \"Can I open a joint account?\", \"Can I open a business account?\", \"Can I have two accounts?\", \"Can I open a savings account?\",","-    \"How do I open an account?\", \"What do I need to open an account?\", \"How long does opening an account take?\", \"Can I open an account today?\",","+    \"How do I open an account?\", \"How long does opening an account take?\", \"Can I open an account today?\","," ]"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CyxRuHdwtKqhdsPGgSk1Fi","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
