The ATM swallowed my card.\", \"The cash machine kept my card.\",\n    \"Why was I charged for a cash withdrawal?\", \"There is a fee on my ATM withdrawal.\",\n    \"I don't recognise a cash withdrawal.\", \"There's an ATM withdrawal I didn't make.\",\n    \"How do I change my PIN?\", \"I want a new PIN.\",\n    \"I think my card has been compromised.\", \"Someone may have my card details.\",\n    \"Contactless isn't working.\", \"Why doesn't tap to pay work on my card?\",\n    \"My card payment was declined.\", \"Why did the shop decline my card?\",\n    \"My cash withdrawal was declined.\", \"The ATM wouldn't let me withdraw.\",\n    \"My transfer was declined.\", \"Why was my transfer refused?\",\n    \"There's a direct debit I don't recognise.\", \"An unknown direct debit was taken.\",\n    \"What are the limits on disposable cards?\", \"How many disposable cards can I make?\",\n    \"How do I change my personal details?\", \"I need to update my name on the account.\",\n    \"Why was I charged for exchanging currency?\", \"Is there an exchange fee?\",\n    \"What is your exchange rate?\", \"How do you calculate the exchange rate?\",\n    \"How do I exchange currency in the app?\", \"Can I convert euros to pounds in the app?\",\n    \"There is an extra charge on my statement.\", \"What is this charge on my statement?\",\n    \"My transfer failed.\", \"Why did my transfer not go through?\",\n    \"What currencies can I hold?\", \"Which currencies do you support?\",\n    \"How do I get a disposable virtual card?\", \"Can I create a disposable card?\",\n    \"How do I get a physical card?\", \"Can I order a plastic card?\",\n    \"Can I get a spare card?\", \"How do I order an extra card?\",\n    \"How do I get a virtual card?\", \"Can I have a virtual card?\",\n    \"I lost my card.\", \"My card was stolen.\",\n    \"I lost my phone.\", \"My phone was stolen, what about my account?\",\n    \"How do I order a physical card?\", \"I want to order a card.\",\n    \"I f